---
import "../styles/custom.css";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#171a18" />
    <title>PxIgnis | Lua scripting for Minecraft Fabric</title>
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Lua scripting for Minecraft Fabric servers: commands, events, worlds, entities, regions, UI, storage, and async APIs."
    />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
  </head>
  <body class="landing-page">
    <div class="landing-top-rule"></div>
    <header class="landing-header">
      <div class="landing-wrap landing-nav">
        <a class="landing-brand" href="/" aria-label="PxIgnis home">
          <span class="landing-brand-mark" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span class="landing-brand-name">PxIgnis</span>
          <span class="landing-brand-note">LUA FOR FABRIC</span>
        </a>
        <nav aria-label="Primary navigation">
          <a href="#docs">Docs</a>
          <a href="#api">API</a>
          <a href="#setup">Setup</a>
          <a href="https://github.com/pyxiion/PxIgnis">GitHub</a>
          <a href="https://modrinth.com/mod/pxignis">Modrinth</a>
          <span class="landing-translate" aria-label="Translation">
            <span>RU</span>
            <a id="landing-translate-yandex" href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" title="Yandex translation">Я</a>
            <a id="landing-translate-google" href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" title="Google translation">G</a>
          </span>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main id="top">
      <section class="landing-about landing-wrap">
        <div>
          <div class="landing-eyebrow">PxIgnis</div>
          <h1>Lua scripting for Minecraft Fabric servers.</h1>
          <p class="landing-intro">
            Commands, events, worlds, entities, regions, UI, persistent storage, and asynchronous operations exposed to Lua.
          </p>
          <div class="landing-links">
            <a class="landing-button landing-button-primary" href="/guide/getting-started/">Getting started</a>
            <a class="landing-button" href="/reference/mc-api/">API reference</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <article class="landing-example" aria-label="Lua script example">
          <div class="landing-example-title"><span>player_join.lua</span><span>Lua</span></div>
          <h2>Events and storage</h2>
          <p>React to events and keep data for each player.</p>
          <pre><span class="landing-kw">local</span> visits = player.data.visits or 0
player.data.visits = visits + 1

player:sendMessage(<span class="landing-str">"Welcome back! #"</span> .. visits)</pre>
        </article>
      </section>

      <section id="docs" class="landing-section">
        <div class="landing-wrap">
          <div class="landing-section-heading">
            <div><div class="landing-eyebrow">Documentation</div><h2>Start here.</h2></div>
            <p>Guides, examples, and reference pages for writing PxIgnis scripts.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="landing-docs-grid">
            <a href="/guide/getting-started/">
              <small>01</small><h3>Getting started</h3><p>Install the mod and run a first script.</p>
            </a>
            <a href="/examples/basic-commands/">
              <small>02</small><h3>Examples</h3><p>Commands, events, persistence, and patterns.</p>
            </a>
            <a href="/reference/mc-api/">
              <small>03</small><h3>API reference</h3><p>Globals, Minecraft objects, events, and methods.</p>
            </a>
            <a href="/libraries/overview/">
              <small>04</small><h3>Libraries</h3><p>Built-in libraries for formatting, items, and GUIs.</p>
            </a>
            <a href="/reference/async-api/">
              <small>05</small><h3>Async API</h3><p>Delays, HTTP, tasks, promises, and mutexes.</p>
            </a>
            <a href="/changelog/">
              <small>06</small><h3>Changelog</h3><p>Release history and migration notes.</p>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="api" class="landing-section">
        <div class="landing-wrap">
          <div class="landing-section-heading">
            <div><div class="landing-eyebrow">API surface</div><h2>What scripts can access.</h2></div>
            <p>A compact overview. The reference contains the complete API.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="landing-capabilities">
            <a href="/reference/commands-api/"><h3>Commands</h3><p>Typed arguments, completion, and permissions.</p></a>
            <a href="/reference/events/"><h3>Events</h3><p>Player, entity, block, item, and server events.</p></a>
            <a href="/reference/world-api/"><h3>Worlds</h3><p>Blocks, entities, weather, structures, and world state.</p></a>
            <a href="/reference/region-api/"><h3>Regions</h3><p>Spatial areas with enter, leave, move, and tick handlers.</p></a>
            <a href="/reference/sidebar-api/"><h3>Interface</h3><p>Sidebars, titles, boss bars, holograms, and GUIs.</p></a>
            <a href="/reference/storage/"><h3>Storage</h3><p>Global and per-player JSON-backed data tables.</p></a>
            <a href="/reference/async-api/"><h3>Async</h3><p>Coroutine delays, HTTP, tasks, promises, and mutexes.</p></a>
            <a href="/reference/mob-ai/"><h3>Mob AI</h3><p>Named behaviours, navigation, targets, and scripted decisions.</p></a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="setup" class="landing-section">
        <div class="landing-wrap">
          <div class="landing-section-heading">
            <div><div class="landing-eyebrow">Installation</div><h2>Basic setup.</h2></div>
            <p>The minimum steps for a Fabric server.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="landing-setup">
            <article><span>01</span><h3>Install</h3><p>Place <code>PxIgnis.jar</code> in the server's <code>mods/</code> folder.</p></article>
            <article><span>02</span><h3>Write scripts</h3><p>Add Lua files under <code>config/ignis/scripts/</code>.</p></article>
            <article><span>03</span><h3>Reload</h3><p>Run <code>/ignis reload</code> after changing scripts.</p></article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="landing-footer">
      <div class="landing-wrap landing-footer-inner">
        <span>PxIgnis // PyXiion</span>
        <span class="landing-footer-links">
          <a href="https://github.com/pyxiion/PxIgnis">GitHub</a>
          <a href="https://discord.gg/FyPWDheyzs">Discord</a>
          <a href="https://modrinth.com/mod/pxignis">Modrinth</a>
        </span>
      </div>
    </footer>
    <script>
      const pageUrl = encodeURIComponent(window.location.href);
      document.getElementById("landing-translate-yandex").href =
        `https://translate.yandex.ru/translate?url=${pageUrl}&lang=en-ru`;
      document.getElementById("landing-translate-google").href =
        `https://translate.google.com/translate?sl=auto&tl=ru&u=${pageUrl}`;
    </script>
  </body>
</html>
